        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/scene_mamushi.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository f756fa79-1da1-43a0-922f-acbf75a5c062).Image",
        "Description": "Your client, Sahara Sherman, needs your help! They have enlisted you, Agent 47, to deal with their misbehaving clientele. These people have ordered delicious cookies from Sahara Cooking businesses, but they all left bad Yelp reviews and said the cookies tasted sandy.\r\rYou must kill all of them, and make sure they never leave a bad Yelp review on any of Sherman&apos;s delicious cookie bakeries. If you succeed, you will get the grand prize of getting able to eat out the whole bakery.",
